{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20267","headline":"牧童词 · 张籍","name":"牧童词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远牧牛，遶村四面禾黍稠。\n陂中饥乌啄牛背，令我不得戏壠头。\n入陂草多牛散行，白犊时向芦中鸣。\n隔堤吹叶应同伴，还鼓长鞭三四声。\n牛牛食草莫相触，官家截尔头上角。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}